# Council runtime telemetry — unbounded growth, and transcripts contain the FULL
# text of every verdict (trading positions, client details, personal context).
# Local-only by design; the ledger is queried in place, never shared.
dashboard/data/council-ledger.jsonl
dashboard/data/council-transcripts/
dashboard/data/vision-critic-ledger.jsonl

# Visual-QA capture artifacts at the repo ROOT (audit 2026-08-20).
# Design/anti-slop review sessions drop screenshots straight into the working
# directory — 112 files / ~40MB had accumulated untracked. Leading slash is
# deliberate: only the root is ignored, so real assets under skills/,
# dashboard/public/, assets/ etc. stay tracked.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.gif
/*.webp
/*.mp4
/*.webm

# Obsidian scratch files that land in the repo when the vault overlaps it
/Untitled*.canvas
/Untitled*.base
/undefined

# Third-party / client material — NEVER commit (audit 2026-08-20).
# This repo has a PUBLIC upstream remote (affaan-m/everything-claude-code), so
# anything committed here is one `git push` from disclosure. Same reasoning as
# the council-transcripts rule above.
#   - whop-extraction/*.txt = verbatim transcripts of a PAID third-party course
#   - the client dossiers below contain a prospect's financials, a family
#     company's internals, and unsent pitch material
# The extractor script and our own index/analysis ARE committed — the method is
# ours, the content is not.
contexts/whop-extraction/*.txt
contexts/stillstone-*.md
contexts/prm-*.md
contexts/aeglos-*.md
contexts/booksy-teardown-*.md
contexts/whop-impact-team-sales-*.md
contexts/ai-agency-course-*.md
contexts/aios-leveling-*.md
contexts/motionsites-case-study-*.md

# Skills IMPORTED from external projects (audit 2026-08-20).
# 29 skill dirs under skills/ carry an `origin:` naming ANOTHER PROJECT'S REPO
# (Superpowers, justinqwerty/design-skills, flatitas/OhMySkills,
# arnwaldn/atum-system) rather than "ECC" or "community". SKILL-PLACEMENT-POLICY
# puts imported skills in ~/.claude/skills/imported/ and marks them NOT shipped —
# these are in the shipped path by accident. With a PUBLIC upstream remote, an
# accidental `git add -A` would redistribute four other projects' work under
# licences nobody has checked.
# They still LOAD fine untracked — Claude Code reads the working directory.
# To ship any of them: verify its upstream licence, then delete its line here.
skills/accessibility-audit/
skills/design-critique/
skills/design-elevation/
skills/design-sprint/
skills/design-style/
skills/error-memory/
skills/full-handoff/
